    "Twelve exact artist credits need reviewed printing overrides; do not fit around canonical-name substitutions.",
    "All23 bonus printings beyond274 omit the denominator; their rarity still occupies the same separate column. Native concatenation wrongly pulls it left.",
    "Five foil-only PW-deck scans use a star in the set/language line; availability of foil on other cards is not evidence that their scan has a star.",
    "Predatory Wurm338 has a visible U rarity; a fixed bright-pixel threshold misses its faint strokes. Use per-image ink/stock contrast and retain the visual check, not an empty-rarity override."
